<title>JAPAN: Shintokogio - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shintokogio - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 15.39		vs	    15.2</p>
<p> Operating	   21    million    vs	    5    million</p>
<p> Current	    367    million    vs	  209    million</p>
<p> Net		  243    million    vs	  231    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.92 yen	  vs	    3.74 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     62 million	  vs	  62 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shintokogio Ltd makes casting machines.</p>
